  "steps": [
    "Take 1 cup of thickly chopped red carrots (please make sure they are dry and not wet) and add 1 tbsp cornflour, 1/2 tsp red chilli powder, pepper and mixed herbs. Then add salt and 1 tsp oil. Mix well.",
    "Add this to an airfryer at 180C for 10 mins. Then take out shake and flip the fries and again in the airfryer for 8-10 mins at 180C. You may keep for a lesser or higher duration depending on how crispy it looks after 10 mins.",
    "Replacement for airfryer : Oven (180C for 20 mins) - Flip after 10 mins."
  ],
